  "title": "17.1. HAEMORRHAGE",
  "source_sha256": "f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605",
  "block_count": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-06-018\" hidden></div>\n<h3 class=\"mm-heading mm-h3 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8947]\" style=\"background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>17.1. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'>HAEMORRHAGE</span></h3>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8948]\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Can be primary or secondary</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8949]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Primary haemorrhage</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8950]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Within 24 hours post op</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8951]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Causes</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8952]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Inadequate haemostasis intra op</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8953]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Slipped ligature</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8954]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Difficult to decide whether to reopen or not</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8955]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Delayed decision can lead to DIC</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8956]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Revealed haemorrhage</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8957]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Following vaginal surgery</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8958]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Packing can arrest venous bleeding </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8959]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Packing require anethesia</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8960]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Concealed haemorrhage </span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8961]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Following abdominal or laproscopic surgery</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8962]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Collection can be inside the abdomen or within rectus muscles.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8963]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>S/S:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8964]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Abd pain</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8965]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Dyspnea</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8966]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Feeling light headedness</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8967]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tachycardia</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8968]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tachypnea</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8969]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Hypotention</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8970]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cold clamy skin</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8971]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>GCS</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"cd1111995382bb9d190b1136\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-018\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure cd1111995382bb9d190b1136\" viewbox=\"723900 -38100 228600 304800\" width=\"24\" height=\"32\" data-mm-natural-width=\"24\" data-mm-natural-height=\"32\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"86448f3033a5c5fa638ff2b319e0c8dc9b82b0ff2fb667db9a25433ec6203a81\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-1cb0db9efb3c09ac5fbc\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#000000\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"1cb0db9efb3c09ac5fbc\" transform=\"translate(847562 8890)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1 161925\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-1cb0db9efb3c09ac5fbc)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8972]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Management:</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8973]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Packing \u2013 usually helpful in vaginal cervical procedure</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8974]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Exploration</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8975]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>In abdominal procedure</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8976]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Ligation of bleeding vessels</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8977]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Re \u2013 application of slipped ligature</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8978]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Intervention Radiology:</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8979]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Helpful in cases when</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8980]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bleeding is caused by aberant vessel which can\u2019t be identified surgically or AV malformation</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8981]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Catheter is inserted into targeted artery</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8982]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 72pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Catheter is fed with radiological help, after insertion of cather, clotting agent is released for example coil, particles gel or foam to stop bleeding.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8983]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>It is not available @ all set ups. </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8984]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 14pt'><u><strong>DIC:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8985]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Following major Haemorrhage</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8986]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Major haemorrhage</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"442fb78f23e749237968b941\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-018\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"im